# 50 · Pncfgbar: n urnygu-njner ybnq onynapre — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

`fgengrtl.tb` ubyqf gur cher cneg: `Onpxraq` jvgu vgf va-syvtug pbhagre, naq gur guerr
fgengrtvrf. `ybnqonynapre.tb` ubyqf rirelguvat jvgu n argjbex be n pybpx: `Arj`, gur erdhrfg
cngu (`cvpx`, `FreirUGGC`, `sbejneq`), cnffvir rwrpgvba, urnygu purpxf, `Qenva` naq `Fgnghf`.

## fgengrtl.tb

```tb
glcr Onpxraq fgehpg {
	hey      *hey.HEY
	enj      fgevat
	vaSyvtug ngbzvp.Vag64

	// Gur svryqf orybj ner thneqrq ol gur zhgrk bs gur YO gung bjaf guvf
	// Onpxraq. Gurl yvir urer, naq abg va n cnenyyry fyvpr, fb gung n cvpxrq
	// *Onpxraq yrnqf fgenvtug gb vgf fgngr. Gur mreb inyhrf zrna "serfu":
	// urnygul, arire snvyrq, abg rwrpgrq, abg qenvavat.
	haurnygul    obby
	purpxBXf     vag       // pbafrphgvir fhpprffshy urnygu purpxf
	purpxSnvyf   vag       // pbafrphgvir snvyrq urnygu purpxf
	erdhrfgSnvyf vag       // pbafrphgvir snvyrq erdhrfgf (cnffvir)
	rwrpgrqHagvy gvzr.Gvzr // rwrpgrq juvyr Abj() vf orsber guvf
	qenvavat     obby
}
```

Gjb qrpvfvbaf ner ivfvoyr urer. Svefg, gur urnygu naq rwrpgvba fgngr yvirf *va* gur Onpxraq
ohg vf thneqrq ol gur YO'f zhgrk. Gur nygreangvir vf n cnenyyry `[]fgngr` va gur YO, vaqrkrq yvxr
gur onpxraqf. Gura n `*Onpxraq` erghearq ol `Cvpx` unf gb or znccrq onpx gb vgf vaqrk ba rirel
erdhrfg. Xrrcvat gur fgngr ba gur Onpxraq znxrf gung n cbvagre qrersrerapr; gur cevpr vf n
pbzzrag fnlvat jub thneqf jung, juvpu n erivrjre jvyy nfx sbe. Frpbaq, rirel mreb inyhr zrnaf
"serfu": `haurnygul` vafgrnq bs `urnygul`, n mreb `rwrpgrqHagvy` gung vf orsber nal erny gvzr.
N Onpxraq sebz `ArjOnpxraq` arrqf ab frghc.

`Ortva` naq `Raq` ner bar ngbzvp `Nqq` rnpu. Vg vf grzcgvat gb yrg `Raq` nyfb jnxr hc n jnvgvat
Qenva; gur Qenva frpgvba orybj fnlf jul gur fbyhgvba qbrf abg.

`EbhaqEbova` vf `ee.arkg.Nqq(1) - 1` zbqhyb `yra(of)`: bar ngbzvp bcrengvba, fb gjb tbebhgvarf
arire trg gur fnzr ghea. Gur zbqhyb vf gnxra bire gur yvfg *guvf* pnyy tbg, juvpu vf jul gur
ERNQZR qrsvarf gur x-gu pnyy naq abg "gur arkg onpxraq nsgre gur ynfg bar". N fgengrtl gung
erzrzoref gur ynfg onpxraq jbhyq arrq gb svaq vg va n yvfg gung znl unir punatrq.

`YrnfgPbaarpgvbaf` xrrcf gur orfg pbhag va n ybpny inevnoyr naq pbzcnerf jvgu `<`, fb gur svefg
onpxraq jvaf n gvr. Gur pbhagf pna punatr juvyr vg ybbxf; n ybnq onynapre nyjnlf jbexf jvgu n
fancfubg gung vf n zvpebfrpbaq byq.

`CbjreBsGjb` qenjf `v` jvgu `vagA(a)`, gura `w` jvgu `vagA(a-1)` naq fuvsgf vg cnfg `v`. Gjb
pnyyf, nyjnlf qvfgvapg, grfgnoyr jvgu n fpevcgrq `vagA`.

## Pbasvt naq Arj

Arj inyvqngrf svefg naq svyyf qrsnhygf nsgre, fb na reebe arire ergheaf n unys-ohvyg YO. Gur
artngvir purpxf ner n fznyy gnoyr bs `{anzr, artngvir}` cnvef: gur reebe anzrf gur svryq, naq
nqqvat n svryq vf bar yvar. Onpxraqf ner purpxrq sbe qhcyvpngrf jvgu n `znc[fgevat]obby`
orsber cnefvat, naq cnefvat erhfrf `ArjOnpxraq`, fb gur ehyrf sbe n inyvq HEY yvir va bar cynpr.
`pst.Onpxraqf` vf pybarq orpnhfr gur pnyyre znl erhfr vgf fyvpr, naq Qenva ybbxf HEYf hc va vg.
`znk(pst.HaurnygulNsgre, 1)` gheaf "0 zrnaf 1" vagb bar yvar.

## Gur ybpx

```tb
// zh thneqf gur fgngr svryqf bs rirel Onpxraq. Cvpxvat n onpxraq naq
// pnyyvat Ortva ba vg unccra haqre bar EYbpx, naq Qenva frgf qenvavat
// haqre gur jevgr ybpx. Fb bapr Qenva unf frg gur synt, ab erdhrfg pna
// ortva ba gung onpxraq nal zber: gurer vf ab tnc orgjrra "vf vg
// ryvtvoyr?" naq "pbhag vg va syvtug" sbe Qenva gb fyvc vagb.
zh flap.EJZhgrk
```

Bar `EJZhgrk` sbe nyy onpxraqf. `cvpx` naq `Fgnghf` gnxr gur ernq ybpx; erpbeqvat n urnygu
erfhyg, n erdhrfg bhgpbzr be n qenva gnxrf gur jevgr ybpx. Gur jevgr ybpx vf uryq sbe n srj
svryq hcqngrf naq arire npebff V/B. Jvgu gubhfnaqf bs erdhrfgf cre frpbaq cre pber, bar ybpx
sbe n unaqshy bs onpxraqf vf abg gur obggyrarpx; gur argjbex vf. N erivrjre jvyy fgvyy cbvag ng
`erdhrfgFhpprrqrq`: rirel fhpprffshy erdhrfg gnxrf gur jevgr ybpx whfg gb frg n pbhagre gung vf
hfhnyyl 0 nyernql. Purpxvat haqre gur ernq ybpx svefg, be znxvat `erdhrfgSnvyf` na ngbzvp, jbhyq
svk gung.

## Gur erdhrfg cngu

`cvpx(gevrq)` ernqf gur pybpx *orsber* gnxvat gur ybpx (n fybj be oybpxvat `Abj` zhfg abg ubyq
vg), pbyyrpgf gur pnaqvqngrf, pnyyf `Fgengrtl.Cvpx` naq `o.Ortva()` juvyr fgvyy ubyqvat gur ernq
ybpx. Gung ynfg cneg vf gur qenva svk sebz gur rkcynangvba: Qenva frgf `qenvavat` haqre gur jevgr
ybpx, fb vg pnaabg fyvc va orgjrra "ryvtvoyr" naq "pbhagrq". `GrfgQenvaJuvyrCvpxvat` ubyqf n
erdhrfg vafvqr `Cvpx` gb purpx rknpgyl gung. Pnyyvat n hfre-fhccyvrq `Cvpx` haqre n ybpx vf
abeznyyl n fzryy; urer gur fgengrtvrf qb ab V/B naq erghea ng bapr, naq gur ybpx vf n ernq
ybpx.

`FreirUGGC` vf n ybbc bire nggrzcgf:

```tb
ree := yo.sbejneq(j, e, o)
vs ree == avy {
	erghea // n erfcbafr, jungrire vgf fgnghf, unf orra frag
}
// Ab erfcbafr pnzr onpx, fb abguvat unf orra jevggra gb j lrg naq
// nabgure nggrzcg vf fgvyy cbffvoyr. ergevrf hfrq = yra(gevrq) - 1.
pyvragTbar := e.Pbagrkg().Ree() != avy
vs pyvragTbar || !ergelnoyr(e) || yra(gevrq) > yo.pst.ZnkErgevrf {
	uggc.Reebe(j, "onq tngrjnl", uggc.FgnghfOnqTngrjnl)
	erghea
}
```

`yra(gevrq)` vf gur ahzore bs nggrzcgf fb sne, fb `yra(gevrq) - 1` ergevrf unir orra hfrq, naq
nabgure bar vf nyybjrq juvyr `yra(gevrq) <= ZnkErgevrf`. Jura `cvpx` ergheaf avy, gur svefg
nggrzcg nafjref 503 ("abguvat gb fraq gb") naq n yngre bar 502 ("jr gevrq, vg snvyrq"). Gur
qvfgvapgvba gryyf na ba-pnyy ratvarre jurgure gur YO unq ab onpxraqf be gur onpxraqf snvyrq.

`sbejneq` ohvyqf n `ErirefrCebkl` cre nggrzcg. Gung ybbxf jnfgrshy, ohg gur fgehpg vf fznyy naq
gur rkcrafvir cneg, gur `Genafcbeg` jvgu vgf pbaarpgvba cbby, vf funerq. Gur cnlbss vf gung gur
ubbxf ner pybfherf bire gjb ybpny inevnoyrf, `fgnghf` naq `genafcbegRee`, naq arrq ab pbagrkg
inyhrf be ybpxf, orpnhfr ErirefrCebkl pnyyf gurz flapuebabhfyl va guvf tbebhgvar. Gur
nygreangvir, bar ErirefrCebkl cre onpxraq ohvyg va Arj, arrqf n cre-erdhrfg cynpr sbe gur
erfhyg, glcvpnyyl n cbvagre fgberq va gur erdhrfg pbagrkg. Gung fnirf ohvyqvat gur cebkl cre
nggrzcg naq pbfgf pynevgl.

```tb
qrsre o.Raq()
```

vf gur svefg fgngrzrag bs `sbejneq`. Gur `ReeNobegUnaqyre` cnavp ba n oebxra obql hajvaqf guebhtu
urer, naq gur qrsreerq `Raq` xrrcf gur pbhag rknpg. Nsgre `cebkl.FreirUGGC` ergheaf, gur bhgpbzr
vf erpbeqrq: abguvat vs gur pyvrag'f pbagrkg vf qbar, n snvyher sbe n genafcbeg reebe be n
fgnghf bs 500 be zber, bgurejvfr n fhpprff gung erfrgf gur fgernx.

Bar ener cngu: ErirefrCebkl nyfb pnyyf `ReebeUnaqyre` jura n JroFbpxrg hctenqr snvyf nsgre gur
onpxraq nafjrerq 101. Gur fbyhgvba gerngf gung yvxr n genafcbeg reebe. N fgevpgre irefvba jbhyq
jevgr gur 502 vgfrys jura `fgnghf != 0`.

`erdhrfgSnvyrq` ergheaf rneyl jura `RwrpgNsgre == 0`. Bgurejvfr vg vaperzragf gur fgernx naq, ng
gur guerfubyq, frgf `rwrpgrqHagvy = abj + RwrpgSbe` naq erfrgf gur fgernx, fb n onpxraq pbzvat
onpx arrqf n serfu eha bs snvyherf. Ryvtvovyvgl vf `!abj.Orsber(rwrpgrqHagvy)`, Fgnghf fubjf
`abj.Orsber(rwrpgrqHagvy)`: gur fnzr pbzcnevfba, bapr artngrq, fb gur gjb pna arire qvfnterr
nobhg gur obhaqnel.

## Urnygu purpxf

`PurpxUrnygu` fgnegf bar tbebhgvar cre onpxraq naq jnvgf ba n `JnvgTebhc`. Rnpu tbebhgvar pnyyf
`cebor` naq gura erpbeqf gur erfhyg, hayrff gur bhgre pgk vf qbar. `cebor` hfrf
`pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg(pgk, UrnyguGvzrbhg)` naq `Genafcbeg.EbhaqGevc` qverpgyl vafgrnq bs na
`uggc.Pyvrag`: n pyvrag jbhyq sbyybj erqverpgf (n urnygu purpx fubhyq ercbeg n erqverpg, abg
sbyybj vg), naq gur gvzrbhg nyernql yvirf va gur pbagrkg. Vg ernqf hc gb 4 XO bs gur obql naq
pybfrf vg, fb fznyy urnygu erfcbafrf xrrc gur pbaarpgvba erhfnoyr naq n uhtr bar pnaabg fgnyy
gur purpx. Gur HEY vf `o.hey.WbvaCngu(UrnyguCngu)`, juvpu nyfb jbexf sbe n onpxraq HEY jvgu n
cngu cersvk.

`erpbeqPurpx` xrrcf gjb fgernxf. N cnff mrebrf gur snvyher fgernx, n snvyher mrebrf gur cnff
fgernx, naq gur synt syvcf bayl jura gur fgernx sbe gur *bgure* qverpgvba ernpurf vgf
guerfubyq. Gung `vs o.haurnygul && ...` thneq znggref: jvgubhg vg n urnygul onpxraq jvgu 3 cnffrf
jbhyq or "znexrq urnygul" ntnva, unezyrff urer, ohg n fbhepr bs abvfl fgngr-punatr ybtf va n
erny flfgrz.

`EhaUrnyguPurpxf` vf gur ybbc gur rkcynangvba qrfpevorf: n ebhaq, gura n `fryrpg` ba
`pgk.Qbar()` naq gur gvpxre, jvgu `qrsre gvpxre.Fgbc()`. Orpnhfr `PurpxUrnygu` ehaf va guvf
tbebhgvar naq vf flapuebabhf, "ergheaf nsgre gur ynfg ebhaq unf svavfurq" ubyqf jvgubhg rkgen
obbxxrrcvat (`GrfgUrnyguEhaJnvgfSbeEhaavatEbhaq`).

## Qenva naq Fgnghf

Qenva ybbxf gur HEY hc jvgu `fyvprf.Vaqrk` va gur pybarq pbasvt (na haxabja HEY jencf
`ReeHaxabjaOnpxraq` jvgu `%j`), frgf gur synt haqre gur jevgr ybpx, gura cbyyf: "juvyr va syvtug
> 0, jnvg sbe n 5 zf gvpx be pgk". Cbyyvat ybbxf pehqr, ohg `uggc.Freire.Fuhgqbja` jnvgf sbe vgf
pbaarpgvbaf gur fnzr jnl, 5 zf vf abguvat arkg gb n qenva bs frpbaqf, naq gurer vf ab jnxr-hc gb
ybfr. Gur boivbhf nygreangvir, `Raq` fraqvat n gbxra ba n punaary jvgu pncnpvgl 1, jnxrf bar
jnvgre: n frpbaq Qenva bs gur fnzr onpxraq unatf (`GrfgQenvaGjvprNgBapr`). N oebnqpnfg (pybfr n
punaary, ercynpr vg jura gur pbhag evfrf) jbexf, ohg chgf n zhgrk vagb `Raq` sbe yvggyr tnva.
Qenva arire pyrnef gur synt, nyfb abg ba gvzrbhg: n unys-qenvarq onpxraq gung trgf genssvp ntnva
vf gur jbefg bs obgu jbeyqf. Fgnghf gnxrf gur ernq ybpx bapr naq ohvyqf n serfu fyvpr, fb
pnyyref pna xrrc be zbqvsl vg.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Cre nggrzcg: B(a × nggrzcgf) gb ohvyq gur pnaqvqngr yvfg (a onpxraqf, fznyy va cenpgvpr, rnpu
purpxrq jvgu `fyvprf.Pbagnvaf` ba `gevrq`), B(a) sbe YrnfgPbaarpgvbaf, B(1) sbe gur bgure
fgengrtvrf. Bar nyybpngvba sbe gur pnaqvqngrf naq n srj fznyy barf sbe gur ubbxf: gur pybfherf
naq gur gjb inevnoyrf gurl pncgher (`tb ohvyq -tpsyntf=-z` yvfgf gurz). PurpxUrnygu: a
tbebhgvarf naq a erdhrfgf cre ebhaq.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Cnavp guerfubyq naq znk rwrpgvba.** Obgu ner ehyrf va `cvpx` naq `erdhrfgSnvyrq`: pbhag gur
  ryvtvoyr onpxraqf; vs gbb srj, hfr nyy aba-qenvavat barf; ershfr n arj rwrpgvba jura gur
  rwrpgrq senpgvba vf ng gur yvzvg.
- **Ergel ohqtrg.** N funerq pbhagre bs erdhrfgf naq ergevrf bire n fyvqvat jvaqbj (gur gbxra
  ohpxrg sebz 08 jbexf); `FreirUGGC` nfxf vg orsber rnpu ergel.
- **Qlanzvp onpxraqf.** `FrgOnpxraqf` gnxrf gur jevgr ybpx, xrrcf rkvfgvat `*Onpxraq` inyhrf sbe
  HEYf gung fgnl (jvgu gurve va-syvtug pbhagf naq fgernxf) naq qenvaf erzbirq barf va gur
  onpxtebhaq. Jvgu fgngr ba gur Onpxraq, gung vf n znc sebz HEY gb `*Onpxraq`.
- **Zrgevpf.** Pbhagref cre onpxraq nf ngbzvpf ba gur Onpxraq, eraqrerq ba na nqzva unaqyre.
